 192:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  *
 193:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * Ensure that X does not shrink. This is not guaranteed by the public API,
 194:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****  * but some code in the bignum module relies on this property, for example
