1515:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****     }
1516:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c **** 
1517:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****     /* If the result is 0, we don't shortcut the operation, which reduces
1518:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * but does not eliminate side channels leaking the zero-ness. We do
