2546:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * Match the procedure given in RFC 6979 §3.3 (deterministic ECDSA)
2547:Libs/mbedtls/library/bignum.c ****      * when f_rng is a suitably parametrized instance of HMAC_DRBG:
